          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-1",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "排队等公交时，他弄丢了钱包。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-2",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "你和父母沟通得越多，就会相处得越好。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-3",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "如果这座地铁建成，去往那个城市就会方便很多。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-4",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "以前我们学校对面有个大超市。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-5",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "虽然我们在迎接挑战时遇到困难，但是我们不应该灰心。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-6",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "我九岁的表弟弹吉他很有天赋。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-7",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "游客们期待在扬州闻到花香听到鸟儿唱歌。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-8",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "我们很开心地得知您对我们的服务满意。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-9",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "这部小说如此激动人心以至于值得再读一次。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-10",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "他不知道他哥哥有没有把那本杂志还给图书馆。"
            },
            {
              "id": "practice-type-translation-23141370-md-43b882ef-batch-1-question-11",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "text": "我太害怕了，一动也不敢动。"
            }
          ],
